    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαμπ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			= foreg., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					37.8
				</span></i>
			; <i>dull, not bright</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψιες</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.48
				</span></i>
			; of colour, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Col.</u>
				793a12
			</span></i>; of sound, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				50.51.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡλίον</span>
			<i>out of</i> sun's <i>light</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				691
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόγαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.3.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαμπέας Ἄϊδος εὐνάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					431
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antioch.
			</span></i>). </div>
